#: ../../library/omv.bno055.rst:272
msgid ""
"``Xc`` / ``Yc`` / ``Zc`` denote the chip's intrinsic axes (as printed in the"
" BNO055 datasheet). The \"Output\" columns are the axes the device delivers "
"via :meth:`BNO055.euler`, :meth:`BNO055.gyro`, etc. ``P0`` through ``P3`` "
"are the four 90° rotations of the chip in the component-side-up orientation;"
" ``P4`` through ``P7`` are the same four rotations after flipping the chip "
"onto its back."
msgstr ""
"``Xc`` / ``Yc`` / ``Zc`` denotan los ejes intrínsecos del chip (tal como "
"están impresos en la hoja de datos del BNO055). Las columnas \"Salida\" son "
"los ejes que el dispositivo entrega a través de :meth:`BNO055.euler`, "
":meth:`BNO055.gyro`, etc. De ``P0`` a ``P3`` son las cuatro rotaciones de "
"90° del chip en la orientación con el lado de componentes hacia arriba; de "
"``P4`` a ``P7`` son las mismas cuatro rotaciones tras voltear el chip sobre "
"su dorso."

#: ../../library/omv.bno055.rst:282
msgid ""
"Chip face up, rotated 90° CCW from :data:`AXIS_P1`. Output axes: ``X = "
"-Yc``, ``Y = +Xc``, ``Z = +Zc``."
msgstr ""
"Chip boca arriba, rotado 90° en sentido antihorario respecto a "
":data:`AXIS_P1`. Ejes de salida: ``X = -Yc``, ``Y = +Xc``, ``Z = +Zc``."

#: ../../library/omv.bno055.rst:288
msgid ""
"Chip face up in the BNO055 datasheet's default orientation. No remap is "
"applied: ``X = +Xc``, ``Y = +Yc``, ``Z = +Zc``."
msgstr ""
"Chip boca arriba en la orientación predeterminada de la hoja de datos del "
"BNO055. No se aplica ninguna reasignación: ``X = +Xc``, ``Y = +Yc``, ``Z = "
"+Zc``."

#: ../../library/omv.bno055.rst:294
msgid ""
"Chip face up, rotated 180° from :data:`AXIS_P1`. Output axes: ``X = -Xc``, "
"``Y = -Yc``, ``Z = +Zc``."
msgstr ""
"Chip boca arriba, rotado 180° respecto a :data:`AXIS_P1`. Ejes de salida: "
"``X = -Xc``, ``Y = -Yc``, ``Z = +Zc``."

#: ../../library/omv.bno055.rst:300
msgid ""
"Chip face up, rotated 90° CW from :data:`AXIS_P1`. Output axes: ``X = +Yc``,"
" ``Y = -Xc``, ``Z = +Zc``."
msgstr ""
"Chip boca arriba, rotado 90° en sentido horario respecto a :data:`AXIS_P1`. "
"Ejes de salida: ``X = +Yc``, ``Y = -Xc``, ``Z = +Zc``."

#: ../../library/omv.bno055.rst:306
msgid ""
"Chip flipped onto its back (component side down) relative to "
":data:`AXIS_P1`. Output axes: ``X = +Xc``, ``Y = -Yc``, ``Z = -Zc``. This is"
" the placement used by the :class:`BNO055` constructor when no ``axis`` "
"argument is supplied."
msgstr ""
"Chip volteado sobre su dorso (lado de componentes hacia abajo) respecto a "
":data:`AXIS_P1`. Ejes de salida: ``X = +Xc``, ``Y = -Yc``, ``Z = -Zc``. Esta"
" es la colocación utilizada por el constructor de :class:`BNO055` cuando no "
"se proporciona ningún argumento ``axis``."

#: ../../library/omv.bno055.rst:314
msgid ""
"Chip face down, rotated 90° CCW from :data:`AXIS_P4`. Output axes: ``X = "
"+Yc``, ``Y = +Xc``, ``Z = -Zc``."
msgstr ""
"Chip boca abajo, rotado 90° en sentido antihorario respecto a "
":data:`AXIS_P4`. Ejes de salida: ``X = +Yc``, ``Y = +Xc``, ``Z = -Zc``."

#: ../../library/omv.bno055.rst:320
msgid ""
"Chip face down, rotated 180° from :data:`AXIS_P4`. Output axes: ``X = -Yc``,"
" ``Y = -Xc``, ``Z = -Zc``."
msgstr ""
"Chip boca abajo, rotado 180° respecto a :data:`AXIS_P4`. Ejes de salida: ``X"
" = -Yc``, ``Y = -Xc``, ``Z = -Zc``."

#: ../../library/omv.bno055.rst:326
msgid ""
"Chip face down, rotated 90° CW from :data:`AXIS_P4`. Output axes: ``X = "
"-Xc``, ``Y = +Yc``, ``Z = -Zc``."
msgstr ""
"Chip boca abajo, rotado 90° en sentido horario respecto a :data:`AXIS_P4`. "
"Ejes de salida: ``X = -Xc``, ``Y = +Yc``, ``Z = -Zc``."
